["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/probability", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A probability score between 0 and 1 of a vulnerability being exploited.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
